====== Buffalo WHR-HP-G54 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

802.11g wireless router with a 5 port programmable ethernet switch which supports VLANs. Very similar to the [[toh/buffalo/whr-g54s|WHR-G54S]] but the WHR-HP-G54 is equiped with an internal wifi amplifier.


===== Supported Versions =====
^ Version/Model   ^ OpenWrt   ^ Notes                                               ^
| WHR-HP-G54      | ≥ 7.09   | OpenWrt versions ≥12.09 run easily out of memory   |
| WHR-HP-G54-1    |    :::    | :::                                                 |
| WHR-HP-G54-4    |    :::    | :::                                                 |

Latest OpenWrt usable version is Backfire (10.03.1) -> [[http://downloads.openwrt.org/backfire/10.03.1/brcm-2.4/openwrt-brcm-2.4-squashfs.trx|openwrt-brcm-2.4-squashfs.trx]]


OEM source code available at: [[http://opensource.buffalo.jp/gpl_wireless.html]]

